om/v/t64.5771-25/473391859_1518112312188611_1355305485291339783_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VaOQvnO95ZAQ7kNvwHlQQti&_nc_oc=AdlprpSY4daznQlwZUyw8fxiDmubDRI9mDOMhhtrR2XZJerCXN1SDkmd3okaUm3VmYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy5DkJCtxKeaJFcm-E3wU-7h11dXdjfJvtbJC5Q0vuUug&oe=69B14984"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00040.png", "id": "628702753183188", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393195_628702759849854_3453678486927347405_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rO7RDE3ZXjEQ7kNvwGeUt79&_nc_oc=AdkEnP3pJglWXdvOFhuU4O24NxHi_K6ENnTGgHhCBTKRaOJkQsjN1mWUuv5dCdSl6nY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJQfwZujPeS7GfHRhXMwZ5cl36to-4xn7Zgud8W-_9dQ&oe=69B16188"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00041.png", "id": "1127727558894208", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393558_1127727562227541_6305939956224130709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ukEQSIvu3HEQ7kNvwFN4kXL&_nc_oc=AdmiCA2TUw1dJfzjTyKzbFEOJ_crIyLfyJTcpwZEdLCNM9tbvyVFLlJT8gNNJx9wwno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw6l5kAcz1c7qJCER-l2-JFO3kMBW8LNVVbiDb9EvT_kA&oe=69B16613"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00039.png", "id": "1139738020612460", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391739_1139738023945793_5280059691858437436_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9JROWFeO4x8Q7kNvwG97-X6&_nc_oc=AdkAD62WgxXaf6xR4OLZGzXI2yjxuipU2kfvOR0E-eG8omFrhVaMDE4Fn2z1ZuvFCTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNtLYRJok4hT3_g20-UYz1V5qz3OCrC8K7met2l31zGQ&oe=69B1712B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled (15).png", "id": "646952687853124", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393453_646952694519790_7054400811726926357_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qbcvIc_svKIQ7kNvwEXp_wW&_nc_oc=AdlBhQFymMm-Vl3MjlYF3z74DvCKBR9lpb2QmwQqgyzos0jovPi1e_BbDMMt8MNe5oU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxRAufl9ZUucohob1331ZX0NTgq_GBnNesl_qZDUIqtjw&oe=69B1466C"}, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "keywords": ["videoplatform", "blog", "blogger", "interactive"], "long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "short_description": "MetaBlogger lets you engage with AI-powered metabloggers in real time. Interrupt, ask questions, and get instant responses as you explore a new era of interactive media. \nKey Features:\n- AI-driven metabloggers instead of human creators\n - Real-time interaction\u2014ask questions anytime"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alindor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"},